Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:57:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07671/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5829 v2:
 object-segmentation perception (the winners' primary view)

v1 nulled with fixated clicking because it showed the model the raw
hex grid; all 3 winners feed OBJECT SEGMENTATION as the primary view
(the audit's #1 "highest-value steal"). v2 adds perception="objects":
segments the frame via arc_color_blob_salience into discrete objects
(id/color/centroid/size), the model reasons "click object #N", and the
reference resolves to that object's centroid. --perception flag on the
driver (default objects). 4 new tests (19 total, mypy clean).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
